<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS4" title="In 7 Results ‣ SCoRE: Streamlined Corpus-based Relation Extraction using Multi-Label Contrastive Learning and Bayesian kNN" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.4 </span>From @M Performance to P@R</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In SCoRE: Streamlined Corpus-based Relation Extraction using Multi-Label Contrastive Learning and Bayesian kNN" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>Related Works</span></a></li>
